<title>SWITZERLAND: SWISS JULY UNEMPLOYMENT EASES AGAIN TO 5.0 PCT.</title>
<headline>SWISS JULY UNEMPLOYMENT EASES AGAIN TO 5.0 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's unemployment rate stood at 5.0 percent in July, continuing a gradual decline since historic highs of 5.7 percent in January and February, the Federal Office of Trade, Industry and Labour said.</p>
<p>					 July 1997  June 1997  July 1996</p>
<p> Pct of workforce unemployed    5.0 pct    5.1 pct    4.5 pct</p>
<p> Number of jobless		  182,477    185,320    161,586</p>
<p> Job vacancies			10,988     10,746     6,246</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
